          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma tubandara aha mwiga gulikugya Ahava aha kiro kya ikumi na bibili ky'omwezi gwa mbere tugya Yerusalemu. Ruhanga atwemamu, aturokora omu mikono y'omubisha n'ababaire nibatuhunira omu kihanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tugoba Yerusalemu, tumaramu ebiro bishatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha kiro kya kanai tugya Rwensinga ya Ruhanga waitu tupima efeza n'ezahabu n'ebikwato, tubikwasa Meremoti omukuhani, mutabani wa Uria; hashangwaho na Eleazari eya Finehasi; hashangwaho n'Abalevita Yozabadi eya Yeshua na Noadia, eya Binui. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli kintu kibarwa mara kipimwa obusikizi. N'obusikizi bwa buli kantu bukahandikwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.34"
            ]
          }
        }
